    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. i wake up and immediately wish i could just... not. like, the weight of being this person that nobody wants around is just too much to carry. i dont see a version of my life where this ever gets better. it feels like the chapter is just finished and there's no more pages left.",
